# Project Specifications

A simple web page where a user can type tasks into an input field and add them to a list. 
Each task in the list should have a way to be removed (e.g., a "delete" button or a click event).

# Primary Tech stack
- NextJs 15.3.1 (app directory router)
- React ^19.0.0
- Tailwind ^4.0.0
- Shadcn/ui
- Zod

Prefer using shadcn/ui components over building our own.

Keep files clean and modular. 
Keep files 500 lines or shorter unless splitting files creates performance or readability issues.